3
00:00:04,630 --> 00:00:07,842
WELL, I HAVE A JOB INTERVIEW
AT RALPH LAUREN TOMORROW.

4
00:00:07,883 --> 00:00:08,759
Ross:
OH...

5
00:00:08,801 --> 00:00:10,010
