6
00:00:10,051 --> 00:00:13,012
OH, BOY, THAT GUY'S
UNDERWEAR SUCKS.

7
00:00:13,054 --> 00:00:14,473
WHAT?

8
00:00:14,515 --> 00:00:16,350
OH, I GOT THIS PAIR MARKED "XS."

9
00:00:16,391 --> 00:00:19,854
LET ME TELL YOU, THERE WAS NO
ROOM FOR "XS" ANYTHING IN THERE.

10
00:00:19,895 --> 00:00:21,396
Rachel:
ANYWAY

11
00:00:21,438 --> 00:00:23,524
I'LL BE THE COORDINATOR
OF THE WOMEN'S COLLECTION.

12
00:00:23,565 --> 00:00:25,024
I'LL WORK
RIGHT UNDER THE DIRECTOR.

13
00:00:25,066 --> 00:00:26,025
IT'S THE PERFECT

14
00:00:26,067 --> 00:00:27,444
PERFECT JOB FOR ME.

15
00:00:27,486 --> 00:00:30,029
WELL, IF YOU NAIL THE INTERVIEW,
YOU'LL GET IT.

16
00:00:30,071 --> 00:00:32,574
YOU WANT TO WORK
ON YOUR INTERVIEW SKILLS?

17
00:00:32,616 --> 00:00:33,909
OKAY.
OKAY.

18
00:00:33,951 --> 00:00:35,536
ALL RIGHT.

19
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:38,413
HI.
HI.

20
00:00:38,455 --> 00:00:39,748
VERY GOOD HANDSHAKE.

21
00:00:39,790 --> 00:00:41,625
GOOD WRIST ACTION.

22
00:00:41,667 --> 00:00:42,626
LET ME TRY.

23
00:00:42,668 --> 00:00:43,669
OKAY.

24
00:00:45,212 --> 00:00:47,673
OH, MY GOD!
WHAT DID I EVER DO TO YOU?

25
00:00:47,715 --> 00:00:49,216
DID I SQUEEZE
IT TOO HARD?

26
00:00:49,257 --> 00:00:53,178
