I'M GLAD I'M NOT CHANDLER.

27
00:01:00,936 --> 00:01:06,191
♪ SO NO ONE TOLD YOU
LIFE WAS GONNA BE THIS WAY ♪

28
00:01:06,233 --> 00:01:08,402
♪ YOUR JOB'S A JOKE,
YOU'RE BROKE ♪

29
00:01:08,443 --> 00:01:11,071
♪ YOUR LOVE LIFE'S D.O.A. ♪

30
00:01:11,112 --> 00:01:15,951
♪ IT'S LIKE YOU'RE ALWAYS
STUCK IN SECOND GEAR ♪

31
00:01:15,993 --> 00:01:18,370
♪ WHEN IT HASN'T BEEN
YOUR DAY, YOUR WEEK ♪

32
00:01:18,412 --> 00:01:20,873
♪ YOUR MONTH,
OR EVEN YOUR YEAR ♪

33
00:01:20,915 --> 00:01:24,752
♪ BUT I'LL BE THERE FOR YOU ♪

34
00:01:24,793 --> 00:01:26,921
♪ WHEN THE RAIN STARTS TO POUR ♪

35
00:01:26,962 --> 00:01:29,631
♪ I'LL BE THERE FOR YOU ♪

36
00:01:29,673 --> 00:01:31,050
♪ LIKE I'VE BEEN THERE BEFORE ♪

37
00:01:31,090 --> 00:01:34,762
♪ I'LL BE THERE FOR YOU ♪

38
00:01:34,803 --> 00:01:38,640
♪ 'CAUSE YOU'RE THERE
FOR ME, TOO. ♪

39
00:01:45,146 --> 00:01:47,900
THAT'S RIGHT, ROSS-- I CAN
SEE YOU IN YOUR NEW APARTMENT

40
00:01:47,942 --> 00:01:49,860
AND YOU CAN SEE ME--
SAME AS YESTERDAY.

41
00:01:49,902 --> 00:01:52,571
SAME AS THE DAY BEFORE.

42
00:01:52,613 --> 00:01:54,573
IS HE DOING
HIS "SHARK ATTACK" BIT YET?

43
00:01:54,615 --> 00:01:56,241
NOPE. WAIT.

44
00:01:56,283 --> 00:01:57,451
THERE HE GOES.

45
00:02:11,339 --> 00:02:12,925
VERY FUNNY, ROSS.

46
00:02:12,967 --> 00:02:17,387
VERY LIFELIKE AND FUNNY. OKAY.

47
00:02:19,138 --> 00:02:20,140
OH, NO, NO, NO.

48
00:02:20,181 --> 00:02:21,976
I WASN'T WAVING AT YOU, LADY.

49
00:02:23,769 --> 00:02:26,730
WHOA, MAYBE I WAS.

50
00:02:26,772 --> 00:02:29,149
HEY, MONICA, THIS TOTALLY HOT
GIRL IN ROSS' BUILDING

51
