54
00:02:33,654 --> 00:02:36,490
YEAH, I'M DOWN WITH THAT.

55
00:02:37,908 --> 00:02:41,161
OKAY, HERE GOES.

56
00:02:41,202 --> 00:02:44,623
HOW... YOU...

57
00:02:44,665 --> 00:02:47,835
A-DOING?!

58
00:02:49,252 --> 00:02:50,211
IT WORKED.

59
00:02:50,253 --> 00:02:51,588
SHE'S WAVING ME OVER.

60
00:02:51,630 --> 00:02:53,256
OKAY, I'LL BE RIGHT OVER.

61
00:02:53,298 --> 00:02:54,257
LET'S SEE.

62
00:02:54,299 --> 00:02:55,843
SHE'S ON THE THIRD FLOOR.

63
00:02:55,884 --> 00:02:58,345
WOW, SHE IS PRETTY, HUH?

64
00:02:58,386 --> 00:02:59,972
TELL ME ABOUT IT, HUH?

65
00:03:00,014 --> 00:03:02,016
NO, NO, NO.

66
00:03:02,057 --> 00:03:03,684
NO, NO, I'M NOT WITH HER.

67
00:03:03,725 --> 00:03:05,268
NO, THAT'S JUST MONICA.

68
00:03:05,310 --> 00:03:08,605
BLEAH! UH-UH.

69
00:03:24,371 --> 00:03:26,373
HEY, JOEY.

70
00:03:26,414 --> 00:03:29,459
GREAT STUFF, HUH?

71
00:03:29,501 --> 00:03:30,836
THIS YOUR PLACE?

72
00:03:30,878 --> 00:03:32,462
YEAH, OF COURSE, IT IS.
COME ON IN.

73
00:03:32,504 --> 00:03:33,463
WOO, WOO

74
00:03:33,505 --> 00:03:34,548
GO BY THE WINDOW.

75
00:03:34,589 --> 00:03:36,591
YOU CAN PRETEND TO BE SURFING.

76
00:03:38,844 --> 00:03:40,095
BUT I COUNTED.

77
00:03:40,137 --> 00:03:41,680
YOU'RE NOT SUPPOSED
TO LIVE HERE.

78
00:03:41,722 --> 00:03:42,973
OH, MAN.

79
00:03:47,602 --> 00:03:48,645
( grunts )

80
00:03:48,687 --> 00:03:49,646
WHAT HAPPENED?

81
00:03:49,688 --> 00:03:51,356
I ENDED UP
AT ROSS' PLACE.

82
00:03:51,398 --> 00:03:53,859
I MUST HAVE MISCOUNTED
OR SOMETHING.

83
00:03:55,234 --> 00:03:57,445
DAMN! SHE'S NOT
THERE ANYMORE.

84
00:03:57,487 --> 00:04:00,908
LOOK, ROSS IS DOING HIS
"WATCHING TV" BIT.

85
00:04:03,410 --> 00:04:06,747
NO, JOEY, I THINK
HE'S JUST WATCHING TV.

86
00:04:16,090 --> 00:04:19,593
Man:
We've lost visual contact
with the suspect.

87
00:04:19,634 --> 00:04:22,387
OKAY, NOW I REALLY
HAVE TO GO.

88
00:04:22,429 --> 00:04:24,723
IT'S SO UNFAIR
THAT OUR DATE

89
00:04:24,765 --> 00:04:27,434
