100
00:04:56,630 --> 00:04:58,924
YOU GUYS ARE
REALLY CLOSE, HUH?

101
00:04:58,966 --> 00:04:59,925
YEAH, IT'S WEIRD.

102
00:04:59,967 --> 00:05:01,676
