103
00:05:01,718 --> 00:05:02,970
HE'S SO SWEET.

104
00:05:03,011 --> 00:05:05,847
HE'S LIKE THIS
LITTLE PUPPY DOG, YOU KNOW?

105
00:05:05,889 --> 00:05:08,976
BUT LIKE A REALLY TOUGH ONE
WHO SHOOTS BAD GUYS.

106
00:05:09,017 --> 00:05:10,685
