YOU KNOW?

108
00:05:12,187 --> 00:05:14,773
YOU JUST CAN'T KEEP
YOUR HANDS OFF EACH OTHER.

109
00:05:14,815 --> 00:05:16,942
I KNOW. IT IS THE BEST.

110
00:05:16,984 --> 00:05:18,610
OH, GOD.

111
00:05:18,652 --> 00:05:21,320
