FOR YOU AND CHANDLER?

112
00:05:21,362 --> 00:05:24,866
WHAT? IT'S STILL GOING ON.

113
00:05:24,908 --> 00:05:25,867
COME ON.

114
00:05:25,909 --> 00:05:27,953
SERIOUSLY, WHEN DID IT END?

115
00:05:27,995 --> 00:05:29,329
I AM SERIOUS.

116
00:05:29,370 --> 00:05:32,457
I MEAN, WE'RE ALL OVER
EACH OTHER ALL THE TIME.

117
00:05:32,499 --> 00:05:33,792
WELL, YOU KNOW
WHERE YOU ARE

118
00:05:33,834 --> 00:05:34,793
