119
00:05:34,835 --> 00:05:36,419
I WAS JUST CURIOUS.

120
00:05:36,461 --> 00:05:38,505
WHY DON'T YOU JUST CALM DOWN,
PHOEBE, ALL RIGHT?!

121
00:05:38,546 --> 00:05:40,090
WHY DON'T YOU
JUST GET

122
00:05:40,132 --> 00:05:41,508
ALL YOUR FACTS

123
00:05:41,549 --> 00:05:43,510
BEFORE YOU RUN AROUND
TELLING EVERYBODY

124
00:05:43,551 --> 00:05:45,137
YOU'RE THE ONLY HOT COUPLE?

125
00:05:45,179 --> 00:05:47,639
GOD, I AWOKE THE BEAST.

126
00:05:47,681 --> 00:05:49,474
I WAS WRONG

127
00:05:49,516 --> 00:05:50,475
OBVIOUSLY.

128
00:05:50,517 --> 00:05:51,476
I JUST, I MISSPOKE.

129
00:05:51,518 --> 00:05:52,644
IT'S OKAY.

130
00:05:52,686 --> 00:05:53,979
WELL, IT IS OKAY.

131
00:05:54,021 --> 00:05:55,647
I MEAN, AS LONG
AS YOU KNOW THAT

132
00:05:55,689 --> 00:05:57,899
CHANDLER AND I ARE
ALSO VERY HOT AND FIERY.

133
00:05:57,941 --> 00:05:59,318
I MEAN, JUST
AS HOT AS YOU.

134
00:05:59,358 --> 00:06:00,735
I MEAN, OUR FLAME...

135
00:06:00,777 --> 00:06:01,736
WHOO!

136
00:06:01,778 --> 00:06:03,238
