137
00:06:04,572 --> 00:06:06,616
HEY, MONICA,
HERE'S YOUR BROOM BACK.

138
00:06:06,658 --> 00:06:07,993
MMM.

139
00:06:08,035 --> 00:06:10,037
YOU ARE SO CUTE.

140
00:06:17,002 --> 00:06:18,419
OH, HEY.

141
00:06:18,461 --> 00:06:20,005
HOW'D THE INTERVIEW GO?

142
00:06:20,047 --> 00:06:21,798
OH, HORRIBLE.

143
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:24,134
I DID THE STUPIDEST,
MOST EMBARRASSING THING.

144
00:06:24,176 --> 00:06:25,468
DID YOU TELL THE GUY

145
00:06:25,510 --> 00:06:27,262
YOU WANTED TO HAVE SEX
WITH HIS WIFE

146
00:06:27,304 --> 00:06:28,263
