YOUR CHAIR?

148
00:06:29,639 --> 00:06:30,598
NO.

149
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:31,766
SO WHAT HAPPENED?

150
00:06:31,808 --> 00:06:33,101
OH, IT WAS HORRIBLE.

151
00:06:33,143 --> 00:06:35,312
AND THE INTERVIEW PART
WENT SO WELL.

152
00:06:35,354 --> 00:06:36,646
I EVEN MADE HIM LAUGH.

153
00:06:36,688 --> 00:06:38,439
HE SAID SOMETHING ABOUT A BOAT

154
00:06:38,481 --> 00:06:39,900
AND I WAS, LIKE, WELL

155
00:06:39,941 --> 00:06:43,695
"YEAH, IF YOU'VE GOT
ENOUGH LIFE JACKETS."

156
00:06:47,032 --> 00:06:48,992
OH. TRUST ME.
IT-IT WAS ACTUALLY...

157
00:06:49,034 --> 00:06:50,702
IT WAS VERY FUNNY.
ANYWAY, SO

158
00:06:50,744 --> 00:06:52,371
WE WERE SAYING GOOD-BYE

159
00:06:52,411 --> 00:06:54,248
AND, UH, OH...

160
00:06:54,289 --> 00:06:55,623
WHAT HAPPENED?

161
00:06:55,665 --> 00:06:57,542
ALL RIGHT, WELL,
WE WERE SHAKING HANDS

162
00:06:57,584 --> 00:06:59,544
AND HE KIND OF LEANED
IN TOWARD ME...

163
00:06:59,586 --> 00:07:01,963
YOU KNOW, MAYBE
HE WAS GOING TO OPEN THE DOOR

164
00:07:02,005 --> 00:07:03,631
BUT I TOTALLY MISREAD HIM

165
00:07:03,673 --> 00:07:04,674
AND, I, UH...

166
00:07:10,555 --> 00:07:12,515
YOU KNOW?

167
00:07:12,557 --> 00:07:14,559
YOU KISSED HIM?

168
00:07:14,601 --> 00:07:16,895
I DIDN'T KNOW WHAT ELSE TO DO.

169
00:07:16,937 --> 00:07:18,730
WELL, YOU COULD'VE TRIED...

170
00:07:18,772 --> 00:07:20,941
NOT KISSING HIM.

171
00:07:20,982 --> 00:07:22,734
THANKS, CHANDLER.

172
00:07:22,776 --> 00:07:25,070
HEY, RACH, A GUY
FROM RALPH LAUREN CALLED.

173
00:07:25,112 --> 00:07:26,696
YOU GOT A SECOND INTERVIEW.

174
00:07:26,738 --> 00:07:27,739
I CAN'T BELIEVE IT.

175
00:07:27,781 --> 00:07:29,324
I GOT A SECOND INTERVIEW.
YES.

176
00:07:29,366 --> 00:07:30,909
I BET THAT KISS
ISN'T LOOKING

177
00:07:30,951 --> 00:07:32,577
LIKE SUCH A MISTAKE
NOW, IS IT?

178
00:07:32,619 --> 00:07:34,079
WAIT. YOU DON'T THINK

179
00:07:34,121 --> 00:07:35,747
THAT'S WHY HE WANTS ME BACK?

180
00:07:35,789 --> 00:07:36,790
YEAH.

181
00:07:38,125 --> 00:07:40,419
NO?

182
00:07:40,460 --> 00:07:42,129
KISS? WHAT ARE YOU
TALKING ABOUT?

183
00:07:42,170 --> 00:07:45,257
OH, WELL, I-I ACCIDENTALLY
KISSED HIM IN THE INTERVIEW

184
00:07:45,299 --> 00:07:46,758
AND NOW HE WANTS ME BACK.

185
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:48,427
YOU KNOW, OF COURSE, BECAUSE

186
00:07:48,467 --> 00:07:51,388
"LET'S BRING BACK THE GIRL
WHO KISSES EVERYBODY."

187
00:07:51,430 --> 00:07:54,099
COME ON, RACH.

188
00:07:54,141 --> 00:07:56,351
OH, MY GOD, WHAT IF HE THINKS
I'M THE KIND OF GIRL

189
00:07:56,393 --> 00:07:57,769
THAT WILL JUST SLEEP WITH HIM?

190
00:07:57,811 --> 00:07:58,895
HE PROBABLY WANTS
YOU BACK

191
00:07:58,937 --> 00:08:00,314
BECAUSE YOU'RE RIGHT
FOR THE JOB.

192
00:08:00,355 --> 00:08:01,773
MAYBE. I-I...
I DON'T KNOW.

193
00:08:01,815 --> 00:08:04,401
OH, GOD! HOW COULD
I BE SO STUPID?!

194
00:08:04,443 --> 00:08:06,194
OH, RACHEL, LOOK,
DON'T SAY THAT.

195
00:08:06,236 --> 00:08:08,405
I-I THINK YOU
JUST NEED A HUG FROM JOEY.

196
00:08:08,447 --> 00:08:09,406
COME ON.

197
00:08:09,448 --> 00:08:11,074
COME ON.

198
00:08:11,116 --> 00:08:12,409
SHE'S BACK!

199
00:08:12,451 --> 00:08:13,994
HOT GIRL'S BACK!

200
00:08:14,035 --> 00:08:16,246
AH, WELL, I'M NOT
TOTALLY BACK YET

201
00:08:16,288 --> 00:08:18,290
BUT I REALLY
APPRECIATE YOUR...

202
00:08:18,332 --> 00:08:19,958
NO, IN ROSS' BUILDING,
SHE'S BACK!

203
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,460
SHE'S BACK!

204
00:08:21,501 --> 00:08:23,753
OKAY. WAIT THERE.
I'LL BE OVER IN A SECOND.

205
00:08:23,795 --> 00:08:25,422
ONE, TWO, THREE, FOUR.

206
00:08:25,464 --> 00:08:26,465
