207
00:08:29,717 --> 00:08:32,137
I GOT TO CHECK OUT
THIS HOT GIRL.

208
00:08:33,805 --> 00:08:36,057
THERE SHE IS.

209
00:08:42,063 --> 00:08:43,690
DAMN IT!

210
00:08:43,731 --> 00:08:45,692
DID YOU MOVE?!

211
00:08:45,733 --> 00:08:47,444
YES.

212
00:08:47,486 --> 00:08:49,446
I LIVED WITH YOU GUYS
FOR A WHILE

213
00:08:49,488 --> 00:08:51,323
AND THEN I FOUND
THIS PLACE.

214
00:08:53,783 --> 00:08:56,036
I'M ROSS.

215
00:08:59,414 --> 00:09:01,416
( door closes )

216
00:09:04,878 --> 00:09:06,754
YES?

217
00:09:08,756 --> 00:09:10,008
UH...

218
00:09:10,050 --> 00:09:13,178
DO YOU HAPPEN TO HAVE
A HOT GIRL IN THERE?

219
00:09:13,220 --> 00:09:14,721
NOPE.

220
00:09:14,762 --> 00:09:17,224
I'M ALL ALONE.

221
00:09:17,265 --> 00:09:19,309
YEAH. SORRY ABOUT THAT.

222
00:09:25,940 --> 00:09:28,485
OH. HEY, LITTLE GIRL.

223
00:09:28,527 --> 00:09:31,405
UH, IS YOUR MOMMY OR SISTER
OR BABY-SITTER

224
00:09:31,446 --> 00:09:33,198
BY ANY CHANCE A HOT GIRL?

225
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:35,033
DADDY!

226
00:09:35,075 --> 00:09:36,451
LATER, GIRL.

227
00:09:41,789 --> 00:09:43,458
OH, MAN.

228
00:09:45,793 --> 00:09:47,795
HOT GIRL?!

229
00:09:49,797 --> 00:09:51,799
HOT GIRL?!

230
00:09:56,137 --> 00:09:57,431
HI, RACHEL.
HI.

231
00:09:57,472 --> 00:09:58,432
COME ON IN.

232
00:09:58,473 --> 00:09:59,598
OKAY.

233
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:01,435
IT'S REALLY NICE
TO SEE YOU AGAIN.

234
00:10:01,476 --> 00:10:02,561
THANK YOU.

235
00:10:02,602 --> 00:10:03,937
OH, RACHEL

236
00:10:03,978 --> 00:10:05,313
UH...

237
00:10:06,647 --> 00:10:07,815
WHAT?

238
00:10:07,857 --> 00:10:09,276
JUST, UH...

239
00:10:09,317 --> 00:10:10,610
EXCUSE ME?

240
00:10:10,651 --> 00:10:11,611
YEAH, LET ME...

241
00:10:11,652 --> 00:10:12,946
WAIT! WAIT!

242
00:10:12,987 --> 00:10:15,656
ALL RIGHT.
I SEE WHAT'S GOING ON HERE.

243
00:10:15,698 --> 00:10:17,075
LOOK, I AM SORRY

244
00:10:17,117 --> 00:10:19,160
IF I HAVE GIVEN YOU
THE WRONG IMPRESSION

245
00:10:19,202 --> 00:10:20,579
BUT I AM NOT SOME HUSSY

246
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:22,539
WHO WILL JUST SLEEP AROUND
TO GET AHEAD.

247
00:10:22,581 --> 00:10:23,540
WELL...

248
00:10:23,582 --> 00:10:24,832
EVEN THOUGH
I KISSED YOU

249
00:10:24,874 --> 00:10:26,334
