THAT WAS REALLY... GREAT.

503
00:20:21,804 --> 00:20:23,181
BUT TO TELL YOU THE TRUTH

504
00:20:23,222 --> 00:20:25,349
I'M MORE EXCITED ABOUT
WHERE WE ARE NOW.

505
00:20:25,391 --> 00:20:26,684
REALLY?

506
00:20:26,726 --> 00:20:27,810
YEAH.

507
00:20:27,852 --> 00:20:29,145
I'VE NEVER BEEN
IN A RELATIONSHIP

508
00:20:29,187 --> 00:20:30,980
THAT'S LASTED THIS
LONG BEFORE, YOU KNOW?

509
00:20:31,022 --> 00:20:32,523
AND TO GET PAST
THE BEGINNING

510
00:20:32,565 --> 00:20:34,608
AND STILL WANT TO BE AROUND
EACH OTHER ALL THE TIME--

511
00:20:34,650 --> 00:20:36,903
WELL, I THINK THAT'S
PRETTY INCREDIBLE.

512
00:20:36,944 --> 00:20:40,156
AND THE FACT THAT THIS
IS ALL HAPPENING WITH YOU...

513
00:20:40,198 --> 00:20:42,533
YEAH, I THINK THAT'S
PRETTY EXCITING.

514
00:20:47,080 --> 00:20:49,165
THAT'S SO SWEET.

515
00:20:50,374 --> 00:20:53,961
I KNOW THAT I WAS ACTING
A LITTLE CRAZY, BUT, UM...

516
00:20:54,003 --> 00:20:55,421
I FEEL THE SAME WAY.

517
00:20:55,462 --> 00:20:56,672
YEAH?

518
00:21:01,510 --> 00:21:03,096
YOU KNOW WHAT
I JUST REALIZED?

519
00:21:03,137 --> 00:21:05,639
YOU JUST FREAKED OUT
ABOUT OUR RELATIONSHIP.

520
00:21:05,681 --> 00:21:06,640
I DID NOT.

521
00:21:06,682 --> 00:21:07,767
YES, YOU DID;
ADMIT IT.

522
00:21:07,808 --> 00:21:09,435
YOU FREAKED OUT.

523
00:21:09,476 --> 00:21:12,146
OKAY, I FREAKED OUT A LITTLE.

524
00:21:12,188 --> 00:21:15,108
A LITTLE? YOU FREAKED
OUT BIG TIME, OKAY?

525
00:21:15,149 --> 00:21:16,274
AND I FIXED IT.

526
00:21:16,316 --> 00:21:18,027
WE HAVE SWITCHED PLACES.

527
00:21:18,069 --> 00:21:19,987
I AM THE RELATIONSHIP KING

528
00:21:20,029 --> 00:21:23,116
AND YOU ARE THE CRAZY,
IRRATIONAL SCREW-UP.

529
00:21:23,157 --> 00:21:24,867
OOH-OOH!

530
00:21:26,493 --> 00:21:28,996
AND NOW WE'RE BACK.

531
00:21:38,505 --> 00:21:42,009
I CANNOT BELIEVE
ROSS IS BUYING THIS.

532
00:21:42,051 --> 00:21:43,261
THANK GOD.

533
00:21:43,302 --> 00:21:44,511
I CAN'T
WATCH HIM ANYMORE.

534
00:21:44,553 --> 00:21:46,222
YOU GUYS READY FOR THE MOVIES?

535
00:21:46,264 --> 00:21:47,556
YEAH.

536
00:21:47,598 --> 00:21:49,349
THANK YOU FOR LOANING US
PAMELA AND YASMINE.

537
00:21:51,936 --> 00:21:54,188
MAN, THEY CANNOT GET ENOUGH.

538
00:21:54,230 --> 00:21:57,817
[Captioned by
The Caption Center
WGBH Educational Foundation]

